      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 1 MARKET PRICE AND DIVIDEND INFORMATION 19 RISK FACTORS 20 CAUTIONARY NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS 141 THE SPECIAL MEETING OF BOUNDLESS BIO STOCKHOLDERS 143 THE MERGER 148 THE MERGER AGREEMENT 191 AGREEMENTS RELATED TO THE MERGER 212 BOUNDLESS BIO EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION 217 BOUNDLESS BIO NON-EMPLOYEE DIRECTOR COMPENSATION 225 BOUNDLESS BIO EQUITY COMPENSATION PLAN INFORMATION 227 SERAPHA EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION 228 SERAPHA DIRECTOR COMPENSATION 232 MATTERS BEING SUBMITTED TO A VOTE OF BOUNDLESS BIO\nSTOCKHOLDERS 233 PROPOSAL NO. 1 - THE NASDAQ STOCK ISSUANCE PROPOSAL 233 PROPOSAL NO. 2 - THE NASDAQ REVERSE SPLIT PROPOSAL 235 PROPOSAL NO. 3 - THE AUTHORIZED SHARE INCREASE PROPOSAL 243 PROPOSAL NO. 4 - THE STOCK PLAN PROPOSAL 246 PROPOSAL NO. 5 - THE ESPP PROPOSAL 252 PROPOSAL NO. 6 - THE ADJOURNMENT PROPOSAL 257 BOUNDLESS BIO\u2019S BUSINESS 258 SERAPHA\u2019S BUSINESS",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS The Combined Company will be faced with a market environment that cannot be predicted and that involves significant risks, many of which\nwill be beyond its control. In addition to the other information contained or incorporated by reference in this proxy statement/prospectus, you should carefully consider the material risks described below before deciding how to vote your shares of\nBoundless Bio Common Stock. You should also read and consider the other information in this proxy statement/prospectus. Please see the section titled \u201cWhere You Can Find More Information\u201d beginning on page 400 of this proxy\nstatement/prospectus for further information. Moreover, some of the factors, events and contingencies discussed below may have occurred in the past, but the disclosures below are not representations as to whether or not the factors, events or\ncontingencies have occurred in the ",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
